{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56053","headline":"古松 · 齐己","name":"古松","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雷电不敢伐，鳞皱势万端。\n蠹依枯节死，蛇入朽根盘。\n影浸僧禅湿，声吹鹤梦寒。\n寻常风雨夜，应有鬼神看。\n（《分门纂类唐歌诗》残本卷九五《草木虫鱼类》七）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56053.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56053","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}